# Formats read/written by the GraphInOut Neo4j reader.
# Object ids reference the graph-format-registry (https://github.com/calpano/graph-format-registry).

graphinout-reader-neo4j ..has type.. tool
graphinout-reader-neo4j ..label.. GraphInOut Neo4j Reader
graphinout-reader-neo4j ..reads.. neo4j
graphinout-reader-neo4j ..writes.. neo4j
